// Sustained line-shaped push, no damage -- the school's own first
// no-damage BasicBeam player-spell. `beam_duration: 60` genuinely matches
// the sheet's own Concentration(60) ("the gale holds for as long as the
// caster keeps it focused"): unlike flame_blade.ron/spiritual_weapon.ron in
// this same batch, BasicBeam really is a hold-to-sustain mechanic
// (common/src/states/basic_beam.rs re-checks `input_is_pressed` every
// frame and drains `energy_drain` while held), so the Concentration framing
// is not misleading here and is kept as-is.
//
// `damage: 1.0` (a deliberate near-zero token, not the sheet's real
// payload): the sheet's own notes are explicit ("No damage; ... save to
// resist forced movement (push)"), but `damage.effects` (which carries
// `damage_effect`'s `CombatEffect`, including this spell's `Knockback`) is
// only iterated inside the `change.amount.abs() > Health::HEALTH_EPSILON`
// gate in `common/src/combat.rs` (~line 1308) -- a literal `damage: 0.0`
// means that gate never opens and the knockback silently never fires
// (verified by reviewer; confirmed by tracing `calculate_health_change`'s
// output back to `basic_beam.rs`'s `AttackDamage::new`). `1.0` sits well
// above `Health::HEALTH_EPSILON` (`0.5 / MAX_SCALED_HEALTH`, a tiny
// fraction of a point) so the gate opens on every tick while the actual HP
// chip is negligible -- the push, not the scratch damage, is this spell's
// real effect. The push itself is modeled via `CombatEffect::Knockback` on
// `damage_effect` -- the same field this batch's caustic_brew.ron (Wave 1)
// uses for its own DoT rider, just carrying a push instead of a buff here.
//
// `specifier: Steam` is the closest available `beam::FrontendSpecifier`
// (Flamethrower/LifestealBeam/Cultist/Gravewarden/Bubbles/Steam/Frost/
// WebStrand/Poison/Ink/Lightning/PhoenixLaser/FireGigasOverheat/FirePillar/
// FlameWallPillar -- no literal "wind" option exists); a visual mismatch
// only, no gameplay effect depends on it.
BasicBeam(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    beam_duration: 60,
    damage: 1.0,
    tick_rate: 2.0,
    range: 18.0,
    max_angle: 5.0,
    damage_effect: Some(Knockback((strength: 4.0, direction: Away))),
    energy_regen: 0,
    energy_drain: 15,
    move_efficiency: 0.3,
    ori_rate: 0.3,
    specifier: Steam,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
